{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:246830574f22e6cfc37afa44714d339f7c4c0fbd3d6175b993f00d13fa0ed28c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64432e9f626e00998fe54f2beed9aa6c00465d99faca111cdddfe26c08e2d78e",
      "text": "好嘞，今天的工作到这里就结束啦！\n辛苦啦，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ace0b029e828615242389f4c4e0467dc089f90d07d881c02a0b89c0efa03cb4",
      "text": "还有。在回去之前，给这个。\n今天不是白色情人节嘛？这是我的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f30c1f37ee664864884fe800148ba7398ffb9b93125c14a89351983db75e66da",
      "text": "非常感谢，春名先生。\n这是……发型造型券？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c99ac698f4bcebe53a7563156c3478f7dd4760344a99b36289092644384bfd4",
      "text": "嗯。\n虽然也考虑过能留在手边的礼物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7292a3d3548663740ad26069751964586bd94e762590fbd6b45b0381a9a58ad2",
      "text": "但要是跟别人送重了也不好对吧？\n所以我就想送只有我才办得到的回礼啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6c952432c13656bd52b0ac017f7dc9bd7ac83e3c2ed7d6024d4ea228d0f755a",
      "text": "我做发型造型其实挺拿手的哦。\n老妈的发型平时也总是我在打理呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6146faefd10b72618e2228a9d04d1dcc8c1f823b5d4bb21ad64b9fe2a845edf",
      "text": "所以我就觉得，要是送这个说不定能帮上制作人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd21053c8d6c20a7944daf210ea69d00f4153f6a48087e09e8ffb7f9a47bc265",
      "text": "有需要的时候，就用这个来找我吧！\n不管是怎样的发型我都能给你搞定！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10dd526e19df0358a43758c9b4921381276ceb37c92844f30285f9d6a2b8f4a9",
      "text": "好厉害啊！\n到了那个时候，请务必让我用用看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_23_5_02_023_23:5_02_023_23:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88eb0c8809ab773b329735ea089dbe1b459f4ea431d11c94e1a491a25dbcc13d",
      "text": "噢！随时都等着你哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
